**Company Overview**


Dadosfera is transforming the way companies manage data, Artificial Intelligence, and Analytics. Our platform delivers advanced capabilities—previously accessible only to large technology companies—to organizations that need to make faster, safer, and more business\-driven decisions.


By democratizing access to reliable data and applied AI, we help our clients accelerate growth opportunities through Dashboards, Data Apps, and actionable insights, with direct impact across areas such as marketing, finance, and operations.


Our platform significantly reduces the time and complexity involved in data and cloud management by organizing the entire data lifecycle—from collection and integration to analysis and interaction—so teams can focus on what truly matters: generating business value.


Built on a high\-growth SaaS model, Dadosfera offers an AI\-ready, scalable, and user\-friendly solution that adapts to the reality of both Brazilian and global companies. We combine technical depth, practical expertise, and local infrastructure to deliver a robust, efficient platform designed for high\-impact decision\-making.

